            "description": "Tactical Brilliance: Whenever you get the initiative for the turn, you may choose to give it to your opponent instead.\nGunnery First: Your flagship, as well as any of your ships within 12\" of your flagship may re-roll 2s when rolling Gunnery dice.\nNational Hero: Your fleet gets a +20% fleet morale bonus.",
